  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "### Minor Changes\n\n- `License.Revocable` says whether the customer may revoke this device's activation from your app, which a merchant can now keep to themselves; a license issued before Moonbase said reads as revocable unless it is a trial or offline. For one that isn't, `RevokeLicense` throws the new `LicenseNotRevocableException` (a `UserNotAuthorizedException`, as Moonbase's refusal was before). The license is still good, so keep it. ([#724](https://github.com/Manevann/moonbase/pull/724))",
